    "long_instructions": "## Trace a Promise\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\nFor each numbered comment in the code:\r\n\r\n1. **Identify the state of the Promise**. Is the Promise currently Pending, Fulfilled, or Rejected? Write this next to the number.\r\n\r\n2. **Describe the action.** Add a new comment line underneath explaining why it is in that state (e.g., \"Waiting for network,\" \"Parsing JSON,\" or \"Handling error\").",
